@@ -197,3 +197,32 @@ script launchers. Replacing either runtime under an unchanged PATH invalidates p
 when the outer runner script is unchanged. Runtime digests are computed from bytes for each
 observation; file metadata alone is not a freshness proof. The Node selector reads the normalized
